    "description": "Cold storage warehouse and refrigerated facility engineering in Nevada — ammonia/CO2 refrigeration, insulated envelopes, blast freezing. Las Vegas's foodservice and grocery market is supplied almost entirely from out of state — every load arrives by refrigerated truck.",
